   "title": "Internet Post Office hacking leaks personal data of at least 113,000 customers",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/southkorea/law-crime/20261128/internet-post-office-hacking-leaks-personal-data-of-at-least-113000-customers",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
