   "summary": "Unionized workers at Korean steelmaker POSCO have voted to accept the company's pay offer after five months of negotiations, the union said Saturday. Union members approved a 2.6 percent increase in base pay, a one-off payment of 6.2 million won ($4,600) and improved benefits in a vote held Saturday. Union members rejected the tentative deal on Nov.",
