   "title": "Karnataka to launch ‘Delhi Chalo’ protest if Centre fails to release drought relief: Karnataka CM D.K. Shivakumar",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/karnataka/karnataka-to-launch-delhi-chalo-protest-if-centre-fails-to-release-drought-relief-karnataka-cm-dk-shivakumar/article71753746.ece",
   "domain": "thehindu.com",
