   "title": "AP to set up Skill India International Centre at Rajamahendravaram",
   "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/andhra-pradesh/ap-to-set-up-skill-india-international-centre-at-rajamahendravaram/article71751849.ece",
   "domain": "thehindu.com",
