   "title": "A Chinese consumer advocate is stranded in South Korea as a crackdown in China targets campaigners",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/world/20261126/a-chinese-consumer-advocate-is-stranded-in-south-korea-as-a-crackdown-in-china-targets-campaigners",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
